{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_grant_14.march","start_line":17,"start_col":27,"end_line":17,"end_col":49,"message":"`Cap(IO)` cannot be deserialized — a capability may only be received, never constructed.\nhint: `from_json_events` places no constraint on the type it produces, so it would fabricate authority from data. Receive the capability as a parameter and pass it through instead.","code":"cap_deserialize","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
